@startuml DFD

title Crypto Analyzer - Data Flow Diagram (Level 1 DFD)

actor "User" as user
cloud "CoinGecko API v3" as coinGecko
cloud "RSS2JSON Service" as rssService
database "In-Memory SPA State\n(Volatile/Stateless)" as memoryStore

rectangle "1.0 Asset Search & Visualization" as P1
rectangle "2.0 24h Movers Sync & Fallback" as P2
rectangle "3.0 Algorithmic Moving Average Projection" as P3
rectangle "4.0 P&L and ROI Calculation" as P4
rectangle "5.0 News Aggregation & Sanitization" as P5

user --> P1 : Enters Token Name / Ticker
P1 --> coinGecko : GET /coins/{id}\nGET /market_chart?days=365
coinGecko --> P1 : Coin details, market data & price array
P1 --> memoryStore : Store chart dataset
P1 --> user : Render 365d Line Chart & Historical Table

user --> P2 : Clicks "Refresh 24h Data" / Page Load
P2 --> coinGecko : GET /coins/markets?order=market_cap_desc
coinGecko --> P2 : Top 50 Coin Markets
P2 ..> memoryStore : Cache fallback list on failure
P2 --> user : Render Top 5 Gainers & Top 5 Losers

user --> P3 : Enters Asset for Trend Analysis
P3 --> coinGecko : GET /coins/{id}/market_chart?days=365
coinGecko --> P3 : 365-day Price Timeline
P3 --> P3 : Compute MA7, MA365, Shift & Sentiment
P3 --> user : Display Expansion/Contraction Forecast

user --> P4 : Enters Buy, Sell, Investment & Fee %
P4 --> P4 : Compute Units, Gross/Net Exit, Fee Amounts, ROI
P4 --> user : Display Net Profit/Loss, ROI % & Status Badge

P5 --> rssService : Request Feeds (Bitcoin.com, CoinTelegraph)
rssService --> P5 : Parsed JSON News Articles
P5 --> P5 : Sanitize HTML tags & truncate snippets
P5 --> user : Render Streamed Intel & Trending Signals

@enduml
